// A token stream for the whole binary-operator chain (par_expr down through
// par_mul): one small "1 <op> 2" expression per precedence level, in
// precedence order, plus a leading unary minus and a trailing bare number
// ("9", right before EOF) that no level's operator check matches -- the
// shared "this level saw nothing to fold" case. Placed beside rel.id, moved
// here to make room: lo/ was already at its 3-entry limit.

par_ops2_setup() {
  lex_init();
  ast_init();
  par_ops2_setup2();
} return void;
